sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Controller
  participant S as User/Auth Service
  participant D as DTO Mapper
  participant R as ResponseFormatter

  C->>S: Request user data
  S-->>C: User without password/tokenVersion
  alt Current user endpoint
    C->>D: toCurrentUserDTO(user)
    D-->>C: User DTO with email
  else Auth response
    C->>D: toAuthUserDTO(user)
    D-->>C: Auth user DTO with email
  else Public/embedded user response
    C->>D: toPublicUserDTO(user)
    D-->>C: Public user DTO without email
  end
  C->>R: success(dto)
  R-->>C: API response body
